\ crypto/kyber_vectors.fam — tabminer's values for crypto/kyber.fam
\ (docs/GUI_WALLET.md, phase 3).  Written by miner/src/fam_kyber_vectors.rs
\ (`cargo test --release --features dev --lib write_fam_kyber_vectors --
\ --ignored`); not to be edited.  Read by crypto/kyber_test.fam.
\
\ kxn ( -- n )  the cases; kxset ( i -- )  case i: the seeds at kxd and
\ kxz, the encapsulation's randomness at kxm, SHAKE256-256 of the
\ encapsulation key, decapsulation key and ciphertext at kxhe kxhd kxhc,
\ the shared secret at kxss; the ciphertext's byte kxta xored with kxtx
\ decapsulates to the secret at kxts; the encapsulation key with its
\ first coefficient made 4095 is well formed or not as kxbad says (-1,
\ 0).

: kxp variable ;  : kxd variable ;  : kxz variable ;  : kxm variable ;  : kxhe variable ;
: kxhd variable ;  : kxhc variable ;  : kxss variable ;  : kxts variable ;  : kxta variable ;
: kxtx variable ;  : kxbad variable ;
: kxc  kxp @ c!  kxp @ 1 lit + kxp ! ;
: kxbufs
kxd @ 0= if
	20 lit alloc kxd !  20 lit alloc kxz !  20 lit alloc kxm !  20 lit alloc kxhe !  20 lit alloc kxhd !
	20 lit alloc kxhc !  20 lit alloc kxss !  20 lit alloc kxts !
then ;

